      "message": "tests: Check that every hashed value uses the ctx-provided SHA256\n\nA plain \"output differs\" check passes as soon as any one of several\nhashed values goes through the caller's ctx. Let the transform probe\nperturb a single chosen block (target 0 keeps the old behavior) and,\nfor functions that hash several values, perturb only the last block\nwhile pinning the number of blocks: if any value bypassed the ctx,\nfewer blocks would be hashed and the output would not change.",
